- Update to LLVM 23.1.2, target wasm32-wasip1.
- Build via the runtimes/ entry point (standalone libcxx/libcxxabi
  builds were removed upstream).
- Source is now a subset of llvm-project created by _service, as
  LLVM no longer ships per-project tarballs.
- Add llvm-pr-186054.patch and llvm-undo-part-of-194317.patch
  from wasi-sdk.

